// Rule: [T1485] STORM-3168 - Azure Multi Resource Deletion
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1485
// Classification: Hunting query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: AzureActivity
// Purpose: Hunts Azure administrative events that delete storage accounts, Key Vaults, Function Apps, App Services, or App Service plans.
// Logic: Evaluate AzureActivity for azure multi resource deletion using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: [T1485] Azure multi-resource control-plane deletion Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics Required connector: Azure Activity Confidence: Medium A match proves a delete operation was requested; it does not prove compromise, ransomware, agentic execution, exfiltration, or Storm-3168 attribution.
// A match does not prove: successful exploitation, malicious ownership, downstream impact, campaign attribution or complete compromise without corroborating evidence.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// [T1485] Azure multi-resource control-plane deletion
// Hunting query - Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required connector: Azure Activity
// Confidence: Medium
// A match proves a delete operation was requested; it does not prove compromise,
// ransomware, agentic execution, exfiltration, or Storm-3168 attribution.

AzureActivity
| where CategoryValue =~ "Administrative"
| where OperationNameValue in~ (
    "MICROSOFT.STORAGE/STORAGEACCOUNTS/DELETE",
    "MICROSOFT.KEYVAULT/VAULTS/DELETE",
    "MICROSOFT.WEB/SITES/DELETE",
    "MICROSOFT.WEB/SERVERFARMS/DELETE"
)
| project TimeGenerated, SubscriptionId, ResourceGroup,
          ResourceProviderValue, ResourceId,
          OperationNameValue, ActivityStatusValue,
          Caller, CallerIpAddress, CorrelationId,
          Authorization_d, Properties_d
| order by TimeGenerated desc
